<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 15b the following section: “ Liability of students or students’ organization, body or group 15b. Where a registrable offence has been committed under any written law and such offence has been committed or purports to have been committed in the name or on behalf of any organization, body or group of students of the University which is established by, under or in accordance with the Constitution, every person convicted of such offence shall be liable to disciplinary action and such organization, body or group of students shall be dealt with in accordance with section 16.”. Deletion of section 15c"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_11> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
