<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_15__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (5) the following subsection: “(5) The Board shall establish a Student Disciplinary Appeal Committee to hear and determine any appeal submitted by a student under subsection (4).”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_15__para_e> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
