<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_m> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after section 17 the following section: “Management Committee of the University 17a. (1) There shall be established a Management Committee of the University which shall consist of— (a) the Vice-Chancellor, who shall be the chairman; (b) all Deputy Vice-Chancellors; (c) the Registrar; (d) the Bursar; (e) the Legal Adviser; and (f) such other officers of the University appointed by the Vice-Chancellor. (2) The Management Committee of the University shall advise the Vice-Chancellor relating to his administrative and management functions.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
