<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_q> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection 21(1) the following subsection: “(1) There shall be established a Student Welfare Committee which shall consist of— (a) the Vice-Chancellor, who shall be the chairman; (b) two members elected by the Students’ Representative Council; and (c) such other members as may be by the Board.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_r> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
