<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_r> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after section 24 the following section: “Disputes 24a. (1) Any dispute between the Authorities, or between an Officer and an Authority as to the scope and extent of his or its powers, functions or jurisdiction may be referred by either party to the Minister and the Minister may determine the dispute himself or appoint a Dispute Resolution Panel to determine the dispute. (2) The Dispute Resolution Panel shall be constituted from amongst distinguished persons from within or outside the University who are not officers, employees or members of the Authority concerned. (3) The Dispute Resolution Panel shall consist of a chairman and two other members. (4) The Dispute Resolution Panel shall determine its own procedure. (5) The decision of the Dispute Resolution Panel shall be final and conclusive and shall be binding on the parties to the dispute.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_s> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
