<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_s> <https://schema.org/text> "in section 25, by inserting after paragraph (f) the following paragraph: “(fa) the management of a Branch Campus situated outside Malaysia;”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26__para_t> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
