<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where on the coming into operation of this Act a criminal proceeding against a student of the University is pending before any court and the student has been suspended in accordance with the provisions of section 15d of the principal Act, the Vice- Chancellor shall, in his discretion, consider whether the student should continue to be suspended or otherwise."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where on the coming into operation of this Act a criminal proceeding pending before the court against a student of the University results in his conviction, the student shall be liable to a disciplinary action and the student shall be dealt with under and in conformity with the provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where on the coming into operation of this Act any application, petition, appeal or other proceedings pending before the court or any competent authority in respect of any criminal proceeding against a student of the University, or detention order against or order imposing restrictions on a student of the University under any written law relating to the preventive detention or internal security, results in his acquittal or release, the student shall be dealt with under and in conformity with the provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where on the coming into operation of this Act a disciplinary proceeding against a student of the University is pending, the proceeding shall be continued by the Vice-Chancellor, Deputy Vice-Chancellor, employee of the University or committee of employees of the University, as the case may be, under and in conformity with the provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
