<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_2__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the definition of “student” the following definition: ‘ “student” means a registered student, other than a student at an institution allied to the University or University College, who is following a course of study, instruction, training or research of any description at the preparatory, under-graduate, post-graduate or post-doctoral level on a full time or part-time basis in, by or from the University or University College, and includes a distance-learning, off-campus, exchange and non-graduating student;’; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_2__para_e> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
