<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@/~cl_6__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (2), by inserting after the words “(hereinafter referred to as the “Incorporation Order”)” the words “or (1a)”. Substitution of section 12"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/12/eng@> .
